[0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\r\n                                     ORIFUDE\r\n\r\n\r\n  \u256d How this paper works \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u256e\r\n  \u2502 The paper is ready.                                                      \u2502\r\n  \u2502 Match the paper to the shown pattern.                                    \u2502\r\n  \u2502                                                                          \u2502\r\n  \u2502 1  An available tool is already ready.                                   \u2502\r\n  \u2502 2  + shows a fold's moving side. Enter folds.                            \u2502\r\n  \u2502 3  Arrows move @. Enter brushes every layer.                             \u2502\r\n  \u2502 4  When the target matches, Enter opens the paper.                       \u2502\r\n  \u2502                                                                          \u2502\r\n  \u2502 Tab changes tools. Esc readies Open paper.                               \u2502\r\n  \u2502 ? explains the tools. u undoes. r resets.                                \u2502\r\n  \u2502 Enter starts the lesson. Esc leaves.                                     \u2502\r\n  \u2502                                                                          \u2502\r\n  \u2502                                                                          \u2502\r\n  \u2502                                                                          \u2502\r\n  \u2502                                                                          \u2502\r\n  \u2570\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u250